\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Ye servants of the Lord,\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 Each in his office wait
\par Observant of His heavenly word,
\par And watchful at His gate.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Let all your lamps be bright,
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 And trim the golden flame;
\par Gird up your lions, as in His sight,
\par For awful is His Name.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Watch: 'tis your Lord's command
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 And while we speak He's near;
\par Mark the first signal of this hand,
\par And ready all appear.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li495\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.   O happy servant he,
\par \pard\li495\sl180\slmult0 In such a posture found!
\par He shall His Lord with rapture see,
\par And be with honour crowned.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li495\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.   Christ shall the banquet spread
\par \pard\li450\sl180\slmult0  with His own royal hand,
\par \pard\li495\sl180\slmult0 And raise that faithful servant's head
\par \pard        Amid the angelic band.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

